{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-34","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平行六面体与平行线与比例","englishTitle":"In equal parallelepipedal solids the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights; and those parallelepipedal solids in which the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights are equal.","book":11,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","contentId":"euclid-11-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddde6597fc0d066154f4cb2d4f1c84a6122e6dec86254768e52ad4623168997a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-34.statement","euclid-11-34.construction.1","euclid-11-34.proof.1","euclid-11-34.proof.2","euclid-11-34.proof.3","euclid-11-34.proof.4","euclid-11-34.proof.5","euclid-11-34.construction.2","euclid-11-34.proof.6","euclid-11-34.proof.7","euclid-11-34.proof.8","euclid-11-34.proof.9","euclid-11-34.proof.10","euclid-11-34.construction.3","euclid-11-34.proof.11","euclid-11-34.proof.12","euclid-11-34.proof.13","euclid-11-34.construction.4","euclid-11-34.proof.14","euclid-11-34.proof.15","euclid-11-34.proof.16","euclid-11-34.proof.17","euclid-11-34.proof.18","euclid-11-34.proof.19","euclid-11-34.proof.20","euclid-11-34.proof.21","euclid-11-34.proof.22","euclid-11-34.proof.23","euclid-11-34.proof.24","euclid-11-34.proof.25","euclid-11-34.proof.26","euclid-11-34.proof.27","euclid-11-34.proof.28","euclid-11-34.conclusion","euclid-11-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de6de1a5496f23be23a154594502ef4b7e6a3abca70b8c848179e48ece0490c3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal parallelepipedal solids the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights; and those parallelepipedal solids in which the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights are equal."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平行管道固体中,底边是对等的成比例至高度;而那些对等的底边至高度的平行管道固体是等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db915f1d484d105a21d85a1e76e70a6f2de383806ff7596cfb5ba56866af8c22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be equal parallelepipedal solids; I say that in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid CD to the height of the solid AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD等量平行管道固体;我说,在平行管道固体AB,CD,底边是对等成比例至高度,即底边,EH至底边,NQ的比等于固体CD至AB高度的高度"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f38fd58e39c68cda5661e3716dbb4564caf696130aafd0470b44e5af2c1f95cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the sides which stand up, namely AG, EF, LB, HK, CM, NO, PD, QR, be at right angles to their bases; I say that, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is CM to AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让起立的双方,即AG、EF、LB、HK、CM、NO、PD、QR,在直角到底边之间;我说,底边、EH与底边、NQ的比等于CM至AG的比；EH 与 NQ 之比等于 CM 与 AG 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ead5017d231437aa452837b0eae729ec3f455c6e81032f2916444b1b8421934","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If now the base EH is equal to the base NQ, while the solid AB is also equal to the solid CD, CM will also be equal to AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果现在底边 EH等于底边 NQ,而AB固体也等于CD,CM也等于AG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85689aee81cc537a323a788cb520a3b879304f1ba1e05259572b02ed332d197d","citations":["euclid-11-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For parallelepipedal solids of the same height are to one another as the bases; [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] and, as the base EH is to NQ, so will CM be to AG, and it is manifest that in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于同一高度的平行管道固体,与底边的相同;由于底边 EH是NQ,CM是AG,在平行管道固体中,AB是CD,底边是对等的成比例。 [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ced6a7b19d820c9e64f28c2ebb82f3b21b1be7a1cf27461de6deda74c1178479","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the base EH not be equal to the base NQ, but let EH be greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,底边 EH不能等于底边 NQ,但应该更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b701a6e90be46649f0ae0a65855152b365d809f3f147745ab303fcfa8a663033","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the solid AB is equal to the solid CD; therefore CM is also greater than AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"固体AB等于固体CD,因此CM也大于AG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"352bc54bec22a64eb85bb62761d3eee9f80e006def29a87dfd8ca519ec87f4ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then CT be made equal to AG, and let the parallelepipedal solid VC be completed on NQ as base and with CT as height."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CT等于AG,VC的平行管道固体VC在NQ到底边时完成,CT达到高度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6ac46c2d14f0b89decaba9348050c85245fc61c26d652003ed39811c39fa34d","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the solid AB is equal to the solid CD, and CV is outside them, while equals have to the same the same ratio, [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)] therefore, as the solid AB is to the solid CV, so is the solid CD to the solid CV."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB固体等于CD固体,CV固体在其中之外,而同等比例必须相同,因此,AB固体与CV固体的比等于CD固体与CV固体的比。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f0f8b5d718c73f04b330ab9fc71abda7267aa40a6bce9febbafda5200f7400f","citations":["euclid-11-32","euclid-11-25","euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the solid AB is to the solid CV, so is the base EH to the base NQ, for the solids AB, CV are of equal height; [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] and, as the solid CD is to the solid CV, so is the base MQ to the base TQ [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)] and CM to CT [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]; therefore also, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is MC to CT."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB固体与CV固体之比等于底边、EH和底边、NQ,AB和CV的高度相等;CD和CV固体之比等于底边、MQ和底边、TQ,CM和CT;因此,底边、EH和底边、NQ之比等于MC和CT；EH 与 NQ 之比等于 MC 与 CT 之比。 [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b4d6e0570fb3c42434a70c7d6fcbd974011b3e582dc7b84b6f08826b0dca1e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CT is equal to AG; therefore also, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is MC to AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CT等于AG;因此,底边 EH与底边 NQ的比等于MC与AG的比；EH 与 NQ 之比等于 MC 与 AG 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aed2661b691b2ad5a5f6e5c6bc00a3a4cd5bb3d74329241d345d9f53be7755e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行管道固体AB,CD,底边是对等的成比例至高度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"811f41f086c6a7e2d2c3880d8c3bc6f26590feac10826d50400a69c04b0eb853","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD let the bases be reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so let the height of the solid CD be to the height of the solid AB; I say that the solid AB is equal to the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,在平行管道固体AB,CD,底边乘以成比例乘以高度,即底边,EH乘以底边,NQ,因此,CD乘以AB;我说,AB乘以CD乘以CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9393ba2a0fddea7c2ab79b2e4828ef6476dcd90b85ce794c0f65f56a608c475b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the sides which stand up be again at right angles to the bases."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让直角到底边的两边再次站立"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b123f7bfecaebf51ace5a3d67cff36cf327b11d11249c612909e3aac2764e970","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, if the base EH is equal to the base NQ, and, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid CD to the height of the solid AB, therefore the height of the solid CD is also equal to the height of the solid AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果底边 EH等于底边 NQ,底边 EH与底边 NQ的比等于CD固体与AB固体高度之比,那么CD固体的高度也等于AB固体的高度"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4b01ad02d93b35c01a930273b911ad24b91a642b87ce5295a3cc9cd760255aa","citations":["euclid-11-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But parallelepipedal solids on equal bases and of the same height are equal to one another; [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)] therefore the solid AB is equal to the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但底边和同一高度的平行管道固体是等量的;因此,AB固体等于CD固体。 [[XI. 31](/principles/euclid-11-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b9384828ba19286555a5d25d4ba9994d0adf8f85f77ed4d93ee9b8494cd9c27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the base EH not be equal to the base NQ, but let EH be greater; therefore the height of the solid CD is also greater than the height of the solid AB, that is, CM is greater than AG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,底边 EH不能等于底边 NQ,但应该大于EH;因此,CD固体的高度也大于AB固体的高度,即CM固体大于AG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":17,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7980adc1cdadf997b60199b84c3898e7948522d7e12591c29762809826d8d8b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CT be again made equal to AG, and let the solid CV be similarly completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让CT再等于AG,让CV固体同样地完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56c8e1826bfa6c771bc4f1c217bf52da03961386dfbb7ccf81806470cf9eddd0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is MC to AG, while AG is equal to CT, therefore, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is CM to CT."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于底边 EH对底边 NQ的比等于MC对AG的比,而AG对CT的比,因此底边 EH对底边 NQ的比等于CM对CT的比；EH 与 NQ 之比等于 MC 与 AG 之比；EH 与 NQ 之比等于 CM 与 CT 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6dd34e72c62e6f8d48fb0ce93ecf4af28615cbdafe6b12961b9d85d701c4ee05","citations":["euclid-11-32","euclid-6-1","euclid-11-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the solid AB to the solid CV, for the solids AB, CV are of equal height; [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] and, as CM is to CT, so is the base MQ to the base QT [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] and the solid CD to the solid CV. [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 EH对底边 NQ的比例等于AB对CV的CV固体,AB对CV的固体是相等的高度;CM对CT的这一比例等于底边 MQ对底边 QT和CD对CV的固体；CM 与 CT 之比等于 MQ 与 QT 之比。 [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[XI. 25](/principles/euclid-11-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bba18f5267f1e1edb3d9b662748bf3f01bb4a229d42718829111e9c4b88ba49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the solid AB is to the solid CV, so is the solid CD to the solid CV; therefore each of the solids AB, CD has to CV the same ratio."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,固体AB对固体CV的比也等于固体CD对固体CV的比;因此,每块固体AB、CD和CV的比相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fea8d84985ca9fbddc54d421422efc8de09b7d65413efb6e8fa86d66418b855a","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solid AB is equal to the solid CD. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB固体等于CD固体。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f50b5d01d9c1d831c4cff45133eb7d8cfea9bc5d077e7d37744888f44bf550f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the sides which stand up, FE, BL, GA, HK, ON, DP, MC, RQ, not be at right angles to their bases; let perpendiculars be drawn from the points F, G, B, K, O, M, D, R to the planes through EH, NQ, and let them meet the planes at S, T, U, V, W, X, Y, a, and let the solids FV, Oa be completed; I say that, in this case too, if the solids AB, CD are equal, the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid CD to the height of the solid AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,让起立的FE、BL、GA、HK、HK、RQ、DP、MC、RQ两边从直角到底边;让F、G、B、K、O、M、D、R至平面至EH、NQ点的垂直剖面从F、G、B、B、D、D至平面到、NQ,让它们相交平面、S、T、U、V、W、X、X、Y、Ya,让FV瓦固体完成;我说的是,在这种情况下,如果固体等于AB,CD,底边是成比例乘以高度,即底边,EH乘以底边,NQ乘以CD乘以AB乘以高度,则等于固体AB乘以AB乘以高度（相关点与线段：ON）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f19aac84ad4f9db5cdfe4478ebd46661db4e7e89aa5825f36def9d30b46101b7","citations":["euclid-11-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the solid AB is equal to the solid CD, while AB is equal to BT, for they are on the same base FK and of the same height; [[XI. 29, 30](/principles/euclid-11-29)] and the solid CD is equal to DX, for they are again on the same base RO and of the same height; [id.] therefore the solid BT is also equal to the solid DX."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB固体等于CD固体,AB固体等于BT,因为它们在同一底边 FK高度上;CD固体等于DX,因为它们在同一底边 RO高度上;[d.] 因此,BT固体也等于DX固体。 [[XI. 29, 30](/principles/euclid-11-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4768c7fa822321627f1a9041a16efd32f579665de6c583e9cb88ffe1560060b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the base FK is to the base OR, so is the height of the solid DX to the height of the solid BT. [Part 1.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,底边 FK对底边 OR的比等于DX对BT的固体高度的比。 [第一部分]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6854f5d38918cc5dc0e74f15e6519a27a3f3374fb5453c7189383abef1391cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the base FK is equal to the base EH, and the base OR to the base NQ; therefore, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid DX to the height of the solid BT."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,底边 FK等于底边 EH,底边 OR等于底边 NQ;因此,底边 EH与底边 NQ的比等于DX与BT固体高度的比"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"734cf2fcdd9b351284e1cd11ad87079026ae1afe013b99587c9463884e27ad4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the solids DX, BT and the solids DC, BA have the same heights respectively; therefore, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid DC to the height of the solid AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DX、BT和DC、BA的固体分别具有相同的高度;因此,底边 EH和底边 NQ的比等于DC和AB的固体高度之比"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aed2661b691b2ad5a5f6e5c6bc00a3a4cd5bb3d74329241d345d9f53be7755e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行管道固体AB,CD,底边是对等的成比例至高度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"811f41f086c6a7e2d2c3880d8c3bc6f26590feac10826d50400a69c04b0eb853","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, in the parallelepipedal solids AB, CD let the bases be reciprocally proportional to the heights, that is, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so let the height of the solid CD be to the height of the solid AB; I say that the solid AB is equal to the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,在平行管道固体AB,CD,底边乘以成比例乘以高度,即底边,EH乘以底边,NQ,因此,CD乘以AB;我说,AB乘以CD乘以CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e051583455461b3f6ec8b12cee2245d1e38cdc7b28a37a62d624c4d8f36c643","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since, as the base EH is to the base NQ, so is the height of the solid CD to the height of the solid AB, while the base EH is equal to the base FK, and NQ to OR, therefore, as the base FK is to the base OR, so is the height of the solid CD to the height of the solid AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"沿用相同作图。因为底面 EH 与底面 NQ 之比等于立体 CD 与立体 AB 的高度之比，而底面 EH 等于底面 FK，底面 NQ 等于底面 OR，所以底面 FK 与底面 OR 之比也等于立体 CD 与立体 AB 的高度之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29d82891e59a36ae2cc6e99064ebb30e7219fdaf793a1816132bef3346f1bd02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the solids AB, CD and BT, DX have the same heights respectively; therefore, as the base FK is to the base OR, so is the height of the solid DX to the height of the solid BT."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB、CD和BT、DX固体分别具有相同的高度;因此,底边 FK和底边 OR的比等于DX和BT的固体高度之比"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5deb9bb611194b2dbe43a0c4f518a865f4ede811c425e5f6be5031181ce61e68","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the parallelepipedal solids BT, DX the bases are reciprocally proportional to the heights; therefore the solid BT is equal to the solid DX. [Part 1.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在平行管道固体BT, DX, 底边是对等的成比例至高度;因此,BT固体等于固体DX。 [第一部分]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ff48b179f730beb876f2a10480349adbae3e7ab2b29b9cbb9ee0c29aaf6424d","citations":["euclid-11-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BT is equal to BA, for they are on the same base FK and of the same height; [[XI. 29, 30](/principles/euclid-11-29)] and the solid DX is equal to the solid DC. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BT等于BA,因为它们身高相同,身高相同,底边 FK;固体DX等于固体DC。 [[XI. 29, 30](/principles/euclid-11-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":33,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e3dc57a49cced4ccc63bea9b838d169e14a9c8b337a40a1d735dcf8d353e204","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solid AB is also equal to the solid CD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB固体也等于CD,Q,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-34.source","contentId":"euclid-11-34","revisionId":"euclid-11-34@raw-ddde6597fc0d0661","order":34,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"661a9ec0dde1ec5bbd3165219c0a56895c3027e95f5cd6c578c3df5bb8f12600","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-11-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.3","euclid-11-34.proof.7","euclid-11-34.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"XI. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"V. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-11-25:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.7","euclid-11-34.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-25","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"XI. 25"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.7","euclid-11-34.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-11-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"XI. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-5-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.17"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"V. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-11-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-34.proof.19","euclid-11-34.proof.28"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"XI. 29, 30"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-34:euclid-11-30:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-34","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-30","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"XI. 29, 30"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-9:euclid-11-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-9.proof.2","euclid-12-9.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_referenc